  <item>
    <title>女骑&amp;骑媛，傻傻分不清楚(上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6793343ad74435e4a37c5ec7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6793343ad74435e4a37c5ec7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jan 2025 07:21:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期节目拖得时间确实有点长了，先跟听众们说声抱歉。毕竟我们还是业余的，又赶上年末，所有人都在忙，还望各位谅解。给剪辑师加鸡腿！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期节目的话题上了一点点的深度，和骑友们讨论了一下对女骑和骑媛看法，更多的从女性的视角去看骑行这项运动给她们带来了什么，又对她们有了什么样的影响。“骑媛”这个话题，对圈外人来说是神秘的、邪恶的、充满争议的，但在骑行的世界，你我皆骑媛。谁不希望拥有一张属于自己的人生照片呢？骑士和骑媛并不冲突，带来冲突的是有坏心思的人罢了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在骑行的路上，我们从不孤单。希望《骑行的嘴巴佬》能继续陪伴你，探索更多骑行的乐趣与可能。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（每个人后面的@，是他/她的小红书哦，喜欢的观众可以去关注的喔~）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：小四 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cc5efca00000000110133d5?xsec_token=YB4U1dPQ76A3kfBn3P5DJx9V8WWoTu4XauUQitinANmZA%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cc5efca00000000110133d5&amp;apptime=1737698961&amp;share_id=fc917e005b8a48c8ad65f805b3dd6fd4&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cc5efca00000000110133d5?xsec_token=YB4U1dPQ76A3kfBn3P5DJx9V8WWoTu4XauUQitinANmZA%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cc5efca00000000110133d5&amp;apptime=1737698961&amp;share_id=fc917e005b8a48c8ad65f805b3dd6fd4&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>@菜腿Jin.小四</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>飞行主持：董小姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：朴熙媛 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5aa0a325b1da147c4c809ccc?xsec_token=YBgP-vfJPEQMK5vZbuejbH5iJLTRDlLcJQMaC4L-1GJQI%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cc5efca00000000110133d5&amp;apptime=1737698935&amp;share_id=e74e86c3502040fa85126612b9dc210f&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5aa0a325b1da147c4c809ccc?xsec_token=YBgP-vfJPEQMK5vZbuejbH5iJLTRDlLcJQMaC4L-1GJQI%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cc5efca00000000110133d5&amp;apptime=1737698935&amp;share_id=e74e86c3502040fa85126612b9dc210f&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>@park朴熙媛</span></a><span>、虫虫 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bd1219a1638280001ba8c2a?xsec_token=YBA_NJ6mzMZEL7RBpjisHLqVImNQ_a_JLTlktlsJH4g74%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cc5efca00000000110133d5&amp;apptime=1737698915&amp;share_id=147717c8c7a6433d8ee88409ff31e557&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bd1219a1638280001ba8c2a?xsec_token=YBA_NJ6mzMZEL7RBpjisHLqVImNQ_a_JLTlktlsJH4g74%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cc5efca00000000110133d5&amp;apptime=1737698915&amp;share_id=147717c8c7a6433d8ee88409ff31e557&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>@虫里个虫虫</span></a><span>、豪皇 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d53a3c8000000001603d7d9?xsec_token=YBbGKJUIiHr1KWnIxGOyhPnNaMuJj6vui2W-zGrPHUkMg%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cc5efca00000000110133d5&amp;apptime=1737698842&amp;share_id=3c8aee91f6024a0db940c0b1a95af282&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d53a3c8000000001603d7d9?xsec_token=YBbGKJUIiHr1KWnIxGOyhPnNaMuJj6vui2W-zGrPHUkMg%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cc5efca00000000110133d5&amp;apptime=1737698842&amp;share_id=3c8aee91f6024a0db940c0b1a95af282&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>@一笑丶奈何</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑师：招牌冰红茶 </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55c30dd4a75c9536d52f4d3b?xsec_token=YBUwB9bhgj0VyuWt1T1T6Uqt458rNx05wj0vqNCg9r5SM%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cc5efca00000000110133d5&amp;apptime=1737698885&amp;share_id=b9a30b68b9fa4a8b97d66abc8ca66725&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/55c30dd4a75c9536d52f4d3b?xsec_token=YBUwB9bhgj0VyuWt1T1T6Uqt458rNx05wj0vqNCg9r5SM%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cc5efca00000000110133d5&amp;apptime=1737698885&amp;share_id=b9a30b68b9fa4a8b97d66abc8ca66725&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>@招牌冰红茶</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《Rage Your Dreame》- m.o.v.e</span></p>]]></description>
